Error [E0302]: The reflected layout has no field `missing`
  --> tests/ui/layout_unknown_selector.jet:3:5
    |
  3 |     missing :: info[.missing]
    |     ^^^^^^^
 Why: Typed selectors must name a field declared by the reflected type
 Fix: Use one of the names in `T.reflect().fields`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0302
